Z||000000||Archie||12-29-2001||06:33 PM||||Today I began the re-assembly of my new car. It will be an 87 coupe with a 3" chop top, no wing, "Warber" vented hood, possible IRM rockers, LT1 5 speed, big brakes, shaved door handles etc.. The car will be painted Pearl Yellow and many of the chassis and suspension parts will be powder coated in the same shade of Yellow. (See the engine cradle below)<P>The interior will be all Mr. Mikes in Black and Yellow & include our new dash.<P>This car will be finished before the WOW show on Feb. 1st. <P>There will be 3 features on this car that have never been done to a Fiero before. These items are being kept confidential for now.<P>As many people know, I usually name my cars. The names are not oness I come up with, they are suggested by friends. I'm not very good at coming up with names, so I'd like my friends on PFF to make some suggestions. <P>Anyway, with the information I have supplied, what would be a good name for this car?<P>Thanks<P>Archie<P>BTW, no, you don't win a V-8 kit here or a free weekend driving the car..... nothing like that. <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-516s.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>Just how fast do you want to go?||||reg||1
