Z||000032||Blacktree||12-30-2001||12:49 AM||||Hmmm... due to the yellow exterior w/ black interior, of course any reference to a bee, yellowjacket, wasp, etc (or anything yellow, for that matter) will be quite fitting. And the LT1 engine combined with the big brakes and modified suspension will make it a very formidable machine (weapon?). So something that includes both the insectoid reference and the power/potency reference would be good. Here are some names off the top of my head:<P>-- <B>Stinger</B> (mentioned above)<BR>-- <B>Bee-8</B><BR>-- <B>YellowRocket</B> (takeoff on yellowjacket)<BR>-- <B>Sol Calibur</B> (sol = sun, calibur refers to Excalibur... and the Soul Calibur video game)<BR>-- <B>Illumin8r</B> (the 8 refers to 8 cylinders, illumination refers to the yellow color and its ability to light up the tires)<P>Here are a few more:<P>-- <B>I-See-Bee-M</B>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><BR>-- <B>Black Hole Sun</B> (if you listen to Soundgarden, you'll get it)<BR>-- <B>LTFun</B><P>Whatever you do, don't call it Black Sunshine. I'd be very unhappy with you if you did.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.tweaktech.com" TARGET=_blank>Tweaktech</A><p>[This message has been edited by Blacktree (edited 12-30-2001).]||||reg||1
